      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOLLYWOOD HOGAN (4) drew a squeeze box and was game in defeat when a close second, 2 lengths from the winner Run Burgundy (20.06) at this track. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Capable of going well again. KID YOU NOT (7) returned a better run last time, finishing in the money (19.92) at this track behind Run Burgundy in a Grade 5. Has the pace to be prominent. Safe beginner but wide box to overcome and will need some luck. Expected to be in the finish again. CHOPPER SURE CAN (8) pinged the lids and was in the firing line throughout but drifted out of it when 6th at this track in a Grade 5. Good beginner but will need a little luck early crossing from an outside draw. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. RAGING RHINO (1) was out of the money at this circuit last start but can bounce back.",
